     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Но мы, BOMB RUSH CREW, начинали скромно, а *Версум Хилл взяли*!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tryce</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="165" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>165</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Утерли нос FRANKS, показали Диджею, где раки зимуют, и ушли живыми, черт побери!!!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="166" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>166</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>*Весь город*, я прям чую!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="167" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>167</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Я согласен.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>red</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="168" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>168</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Я хочу знать, кем я был. *Какие у меня корни*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="169" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>169</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Не могу объяснить, но... Весь город. Я прям чувствую, что в этом мое предназначение.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="170" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>170</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Даже если мне придется довериться этому шизику, *Диджей Сайбер — моя единственная зацепка*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="171" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>171</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Погоди. Мы команда, не забывай.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>tryce</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="172" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>172</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Мы все в одной лодке. Если ты пойдешь, мы все пойдем.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="173" calcext:value-type="float">
