      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Когда-то я был королем Матаана. Я тут с самого основания!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="266" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>266</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Хмм... Тут не больше пяти зданий было — и на каждом мой тег!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="267" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>267</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>А раньше я жил в *Старом Амстердаме*. Этот город ты и представить себе не можешь.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="268" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>268</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Нынче молодежь и дерево-то в глаза не видела. А тогда были целые леса!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="269" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>269</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Чудо природ — *свободно растущий источник кислорода*!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="270" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>270</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Их бы снова насажать везде, вот что я вам скажу.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1024"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="271" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>271</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>...Э? Чего я делаю?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>oldhead not enough rep</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="272" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>272</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Хорошо провожу время! Я всегда была душой компании.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="273" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>273</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>А в мое время, на тусовку можно было даже не соваться без...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="274" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>274</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>...без *155 РЕП*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1024"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="275" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>275</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ага, получилось репутации наколотить!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>oldhead enough rep</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="276" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>276</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Все-таки ваше поколение славное. А я так, чисто доживаю...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="277" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>277</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Вон тут, в глубине Матаана, мне особенно нравится. Напоминает старые каналы.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="278" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>278</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>И улица вот с этого места. Прям ностальгия.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="279" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>279</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>В *старом городе* у нас был такой же квартал.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="280" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>280</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Аааа... Да... Море не ведает наших помыслов и бед.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1024"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="440" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>440</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Переключиться на *скейт*?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>in the hideout for switching movestyle, also takes you to the menu to switch colors on your skateboard/skates/bmx</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="441" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>441</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Переключиться на *ролики*?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="442" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>442</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Переключиться на *BMX*?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce80" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>take a taxi, spoken by Benni, the taxi driver. can be in any stage</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="443" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>443</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Эй! Подбросить?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>When the taxi shows up after you’ve danced at a sign</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="444" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>444</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Поехали.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>when you’ve chosen a destination and you leave in the taxi</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="445" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>445</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>На месте. Ну, до встречи!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>when you’ve arrived at your destination with the taxi</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="446" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>446</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ага, ок. Без проблем. Увидимся!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>when you choose to cancel the taxi ride before chosing</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce80" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>when interacting with the taxi sign (no speaking character)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="447" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>447</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Отсюда тебя могут *подвезти*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="448" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>448</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>(Когда ты сядешь в *такси*, это место станет доступно в качестве *пункта назначения*).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1024"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="449" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>449</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Пройди сюда, чтобы переключиться на *BMX* или изменить *стиль* своего BMX.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>shown when the BMX garage door opens</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="450" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>450</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Пройди сюда, чтобы переключиться на *ролики* или изменить *стиль* своих роликов.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>shown when the skates garage door opens</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="451" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>451</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Пройди сюда, чтобы переключиться на *скейт* или изменить *стиль* своего скейта.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>shown when the skateboard garage door opens</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce80" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Mataan sidemissions with Coil</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="283" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>283</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Йоу, ты тоже райтер?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="284" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>284</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Меня зовут *Койл*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1024"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
