    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_SHINE_05_P4_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Давай, может, туда?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_01_SUBJECT</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Быстрые трюки</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_01_P1_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ред, ты пробовал трюки с ускорением?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_01_P2_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ускорься, когда делаешь трюк.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_01_P3_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Во время трюка у тебя должно оставаться немного ускорения в запасе.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_01_P4_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Такое вот исполнение даст тебе больше очков...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_01_P5_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>...и заново запустит отсчет до прерывания комбо, когда ты гоняешь мануал.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_02_SUBJECT</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Идешь?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_02_P1_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Эй! Мы тут в логове собрались передохнуть.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_02_P2_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Хватай такси — и давай к нам!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_02_P3_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Как будешь здесь, попробуй сменить стиль езды</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_02_P4_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>или просто поменяй внешний вид скейта или роликов.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_03_SUBJECT</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Командные баттлы</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_03_P1_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Когда пойдем против DOT EXE, надо будет как следует выступить!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_03_P2_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Надо будет набивать *множители комбо*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_03_P3_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Входи *в повороты*, *бегай по стенам*, катись по *рампам*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_03_P4_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Повороты, стены и рампы добавляют множитель</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_03_P5_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>только *в первый раз*, когда ты по ним проезжаешь за одно испытание. </text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_03_P6_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Чтобы увеличивать комбо, ищи необкатанные места!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_04_SUBJECT</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ускорение</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_04_P1_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Граффити может придать тебе *ускорение*! Серьезно :D</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_04_P2_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Отвечаю! Накидай *новый арт*, и будет тебе ускорение!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH3_TRYCE_04_P3_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Так что для быстрой езды накидывай разное.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce106" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>// Chapter 4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_BEL_01_SUBJECT</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>BMX</text:p>
