    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_BEL_01_P1_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Если вдруг не заметил...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_BEL_01_P2_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>В логове можно переключиться на BMX.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_BEL_01_P3_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ну и поменять внешний вид BMX, если хочешь.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_BEL_02_SUBJECT</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Повторяющиеся трюки</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_BEL_02_P1_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Я тут хочу поделиться советом про трюки</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_BEL_02_P2_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>*Повторяющиеся трюки* дают меньше очков. </text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_BEL_02_P3_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Чередуй *грайнды, трюки на земле, вертикальные трюки*...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_BEL_02_P4_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>...и *катайся по стенам*. Чтобы уныло не было, сечешь?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>EMAIL_CH4_BEL_02_P5_MSG</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Тогда счет будет охренительный!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
