     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>NOTIFICATION_HIDEOUT_MAP</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Открой *телефон* с помощью [PhoneMoveRight] и посмотри, что есть на *карте*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
