     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Используй [trick1], [trick2] и [trick3], чтобы выполнить *15 трюков* как в комбо-связке *Бел*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>shown at the third challenge of Bel in hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
